# Single source of truth for logical paths and source files.
#
# Iris / stdpp are found automatically in Coq's user-contrib (apt
# package libcoq-iris, or opam coq-iris). lambda-rust is NOT listed
# here with an absolute -Q path because that is machine-specific; the
# Makefile injects the lambda-rust paths from $(LRUST_BASE) for the
# three Tier-C files that need them. For IDE use of the Tier-C files,
# either install lambda-rust via opam (lands in user-contrib) or set
# COQPATH to your lambda-rust checkout.
#
# NOTE: The Makefile in this directory is hand-written. Do NOT run
# `coq_makefile -f _CoqProject -o Makefile`; it would overwrite the
# Makefile and drop the lambda-rust path handling.

-Q . Top
-arg -w -arg -notation-overridden
-arg -w -arg -masking-absolute-name

# --- Pure Coq (Coq stdlib only) ---
BudgetAbstract.v
BudgetLinearTrace.v
BudgetTypedCap.v
BudgetTraceRefinementPure.v

# --- Tier B (needs Iris) ---
BudgetIris.v
BudgetIrisTypedCap.v
BudgetTraceRefinement.v

# --- Tier C (needs Iris + lambda-rust) ---
BudgetRustBelt.v
BudgetRustBeltTypedCap.v

# --- Assumptions audit (Print Assumptions; needs Tier C) ---
VerifyAssumptions.v
